# comment(@sprf …) bidirectional smoke.
# Spec: v3/docs/v3-render-write-cursor-vision.md
# Status: DOES NOT PARSE TODAY — uses @begin/@end comment markers
#   pending grammar landing in sprefa-p0m. eval op + comment body
#   re-entry semantics also pending in same card.
#
# Comment op extension recognises @sprf prefix and re-enters the host
# parser on the body, lowering it as Value::Pipeline. The eval op
# consumes a Value::Pipeline cursor and runs it as an inner pipeline.

# Read direction: discover sprf snippets embedded in source comments
# across the repo, run each one in-place. Polyglot — comment op strips
# language-specific comment delimiters before matching @sprf.
fs(glob(**/*.{rs,ts,py,go}))
  > comment(@sprf ${BODY?})
  > eval(${BODY?});

# Write direction: comment-bounded scope as render target. SCOPE.byte_range
# covers the body between markers; write_cursor splices into it.
fs(glob(./src/lib.rs))
  > comment(@begin module-list ${SCOPE?} @end);

fs(glob(./src/*.rs))
  > render[md](- ${fs.stem})
  > write_cursor(${SCOPE?});
